.nh
.TH "LAGO" "1" "Sep 2026" "Lago CLI" "Lago CLI Manual"

.SH NAME
lago-v2-api-logs-list - List api logs


.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBlago v2 api-logs list [flags]\fP


.SH DESCRIPTION
Returns a cursor-paginated list ordered by log time, newest first. Use after or before to navigate. The page and per_page parameters are rejected.
Requires a premium license and available log storage. Results are ordered by logged_at and request_id, both descending, within the configured retention period.
Requires the product catalog to be enabled and api_log read permission on the API key.


.SH OPTIONS
\fB--after\fP=""
	Opaque next_cursor from a previous response. Returns the next page. Cannot be combined with before or include_total_count=true. Keep the same filters when paging.

.PP
\fB--all\fP[=false]
	Fetch every page by following next_cursor

.PP
\fB--api-version\fP=""
	Api version.

.PP
\fB--before\fP=""
	Opaque prev_cursor from a previous response. Returns the previous page in the same list order. Cannot be combined with after or include_total_count=true. Keep the same filters when paging.

.PP
\fB--clients\fP=""
	Clients[].

.PP
\fB--from-date\fP=""
	Inclusive lower log-time bound as an ISO 8601 date or timestamp. A date is interpreted as midnight UTC.

.PP
\fB-h\fP, \fB--help\fP[=false]
	help for list

.PP
\fB--http-methods\fP=""
	Http methods[].

.PP
\fB--http-statuses\fP=""
	HTTP status codes or status groups. succeeded selects codes up to 399; failed selects codes above 399. Groups take precedence over numeric codes. Selecting both groups returns no matches.

.PP
\fB--include-total-count\fP=""
	Requests the total number of matching records. Supported only on the first page, without after or before. The count can be estimated; total_count_estimated is then present and true.

.PP
\fB--limit\fP=""
	Maximum number of records per page. Values outside the supported range return 400.

.PP
\fB--request-paths\fP=""
	Request paths[].

.PP
\fB--to-date\fP=""
	Inclusive upper log-time bound as an ISO 8601 date or timestamp. A date is interpreted as midnight UTC.

.PP
\fB--watch\fP[=false]
	Poll and re-render when the response changes

.PP
\fB--watch-interval\fP=2s
	Polling interval used with --watch


.SH OPTIONS INHERITED FROM PARENT COMMANDS
\fB--api-key\fP=""
	Override the Lago API key

.PP
\fB--api-url\fP=""
	Override the Lago API URL

.PP
\fB--confirm\fP=""
	Confirm a dangerous operation with its resource identifier

.PP
\fB--dry-run\fP[=false]
	Print mutating requests without sending them

.PP
\fB--insecure\fP[=false]
	Allow insecure HTTP or TLS for self-hosted Lago

.PP
\fB--mode\fP=""
	Environment mode: live or test

.PP
\fB--no-retry\fP[=false]
	Disable automatic retries

.PP
\fB-o\fP, \fB--output\fP="table"
	Output format: table, json, or yaml

.PP
\fB--profile\fP=""
	Named profile to use

.PP
\fB--query\fP=""
	JMESPath expression applied to the response

.PP
\fB--timeout\fP=30s
	Total request timeout

.PP
\fB--timing\fP[=false]
	Print request latency breakdown

.PP
\fB--verbose\fP[=false]
	Print redacted request and response details


.SH EXAMPLE
.EX
  lago v2 api-logs list
.EE


.SH SEE ALSO
\fBlago-v2-api-logs(1)\fP
